      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you cant give official medical advice but i'm just looking for some general info. i've read online that both of these are just sedatives so wouldn't they basically do the same thing? i just want to know if there's any major reason why doctors usually say no to mixing them or if it's just a precaution. i'm really struggling here.",
